      "id": "hai",
      "name": "亥"
    },
    {
      "id": "artisan-chui",
      "name": "玉匠垂"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "gate-road",
      "npc": "玉匠垂",
      "characterId": "artisan-chui",
      "dialogueId": "mengjin-workshop-opening"
    }
  ],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "mengjin-workshop-opening",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "name": "旁白"
          },
          "text": "孟津，日光斜照进玉匠铺。亥停在案边，看玉匠垂在玉片上刻下两种纹路。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "hai"
          },
          "expression": "thinking",
          "text": "这玉片上，怎么只刻两种纹？多刻几种，不是更省事吗？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "artisan-chui"
          },
          "text": "纹样可以多，辨认却未必容易。我先让每一处只有两种模样，免得看错。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "hai"
          },
          "expression": "surprised",
          "text": "只有两种模样，也能记下许多事情？"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "那你说说，怎么记？",
          "target": {
            "type": "dialogue",
            "id": "mengjin-workshop-explanation"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mengjin-workshop-explanation",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "artisan-chui"
          },
          "text": "先看一处。它有两种样子，我们约定一种记作零，另一种记作一。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "hai"
          },
          "expression": "thinking",
          "text": "那并排放上两处，就能分别看它们的模样。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "artisan-chui"
          },
          "text": "正是。依次可以记成零零、零一、一零、一一。两处，便有四种不同的组合。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "hai"
          },
          "expression": "smile",
          "text": "原来不是让每处都变得复杂，而是把几处排在一起！"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "抱歉，有点不懂，能再说一遍吗",
          "target": {
            "type": "dialogue",
            "id": "mengjin-workshop-explanation"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我明白了，继续",
          "target": {
            "type": "dialogue",
            "id": "mengjin-workshop-closing"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mengjin-workshop-closing",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "artisan-chui"
          },
          "text": "不过，先要约定从哪一端读起，同一个组合又代表什么。约定不同，读出的意思也会不同。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "hai"
          },
          "expression": "thinking",
          "text": "这么说，纹路只是记号，意思还得由人先说明白。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "artisan-chui"
          },
          "text": "不错。你若有兴致，下回便来试着刻一组。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": {
            "characterId": "hai"
          },
          "expression": "smile",
          "text": "这个倒有意思。下回我带着自己的记法来！"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
